From ed8baf5de7bfe73208974d08a570acc95f978437 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: akimfomin <akim.fomin@mail.ru>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:32:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Recompiler: project known pixel ballot bits at their SSA
 consumer

Keep all four original wave ballots and every whole-mask consumer. An identified own-bit reader in the same block can test its quad nibble directly. This offline comparison retains full reconstruction on phi edges, whole reads, mixed registers, and all other unrecognized cases.
